If there is a clinician then it is recommended that the clinician does not treat an acute-pain with an ER-LA-opioid.
If there is a clinician then it is recommended that the clinician does not initiate an ER-LA-opioid for a subacute-pain.
If there is a clinician then it is recommended that the clinician does not initiate an ER-LA-opioid for a chronic-pain.
If there is a clinician then it is recommended that the clinician does not prescribe an ER-LA-opioid for an intermittent-or-as-needed-use.
